{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14333","headline":"江陵遇元九李六二侍御纪事书情呈十二韵 · 窦巩","name":"江陵遇元九李六二侍御纪事书情呈十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自见人相爱，如君爱我稀。\n好闲容问道，攻短每言非。\n梦想何曾间，追欢未省违。\n看花怜後到，避酒许先归。\n柳寺春堤远，津桥曙月微。\n渔翁随去处，禅客共因依。\n蓬阁初疑义，霜台晚畏威。\n学深通古字，心直触危机。\n肯滞荆州掾，犹香柏署衣。\n山连巫峡秀，田傍渚宫肥。\n美玉方齐价，迁鸎尚怯飞。\n伫看霄汉上，连步侍彤闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦巩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}